{"vid":"PzGRgTNAhbU","source":"PzGRgTNAhbU.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"So, you're considering a career as an"},{"t":1.8,"txt":"industrial electrician. In this video, I"},{"t":3.8,"txt":"just want to talk about what I actually"},{"t":5.5,"txt":"do every day, and I have news for you."},{"t":8,"txt":"It's not installing wires and running"},{"t":10.2,"txt":"conduit. That's actually a very small"},{"t":11.8,"txt":"part of the job. It's more complicated"},{"t":13.8,"txt":"than that. Come with me for a couple"},{"t":15.4,"txt":"minutes. Let's talk [music] about job"},{"t":17.5,"txt":"duties as an industrial electrician."},{"t":21,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":23.4,"txt":">> Troubleshooting circuits. A lot of"},{"t":25,"txt":"times, machines don't work. Sometimes"},{"t":27.2,"txt":"you got to replace a fuse. Sometimes you"},{"t":29.1,"txt":"got to get out your multimeter and"},{"t":30.4,"txt":"diagnose, you know, where the fault is."},{"t":33,"txt":"Maybe a safety circuit isn't working or,"},{"t":35.7,"txt":"you know, you're not getting a PLC input"},{"t":37.4,"txt":"that you're supposed to get. So, that"},{"t":38.9,"txt":"requires multimeter usage,"},{"t":41.3,"txt":"troubleshooting circuits, and just"},{"t":43.5,"txt":"understanding of how electrical and"},{"t":45.4,"txt":"electrical theory works. So, that's"},{"t":47.3,"txt":"number one. Number two, you need to"},{"t":49.8,"txt":"understand how the machines operate. So,"},{"t":52.6,"txt":"in order to get to that level where you"},{"t":54.1,"txt":"understand how the machines operate, you"},{"t":56.3,"txt":"got to be a self-starter. You got to be"},{"t":58.4,"txt":"motivated. You got to get out on the"},{"t":60.4,"txt":"floor and just check things out on your"},{"t":62,"txt":"own."},{"t":64.1,"txt":"I will say this, I do work an off shift,"},{"t":66.3,"txt":"and for some people that's a big"},{"t":67.5,"txt":"negative. But, for me it's actually a"},{"t":69.1,"txt":"big positive. I just really like the"},{"t":70.7,"txt":"independence about it. And we could talk"},{"t":72.5,"txt":"a little bit more about that later."},{"t":74.4,"txt":"Something else I do is I troubleshoot"},{"t":76.5,"txt":"robots. Well, for whatever reason,"},{"t":78.4,"txt":"things aren't operating the way they're"},{"t":79.6,"txt":"supposed to. So, I got to get in there"},{"t":81.7,"txt":"and troubleshoot robot programming and"},{"t":84.4,"txt":"just do robot work. I drive the robots"},{"t":86.6,"txt":"and change the set down points of the"},{"t":88,"txt":"robot, things like that. The other thing"},{"t":90.1,"txt":"I need to do is calibrations."},{"t":93,"txt":"This is where my history comes in. I"},{"t":94.2,"txt":"used to be an instrumentation electrical"},{"t":96,"txt":"technician, then I was an automation and"},{"t":98.2,"txt":"electrical technician, and I was a"},{"t":99.9,"txt":"senior instrumentation technician."},{"t":102.7,"txt":"And I was an instrumentation and"},{"t":104.1,"txt":"electrical technician. I would think I"},{"t":105.4,"txt":"already said that one. Anyways, one"},{"t":107.3,"txt":"thing that's in common with all the jobs"},{"t":109.1,"txt":"I did a ton of calibrations. Now I'm an"},{"t":110.7,"txt":"industrial electrician. Guess what? I'm"},{"t":112.4,"txt":"still doing calibrations, but not as"},{"t":114.2,"txt":"much."},{"t":116.1,"txt":"If anyone from my company is watching, I"},{"t":117.9,"txt":"am not giving out any specifics. I'm"},{"t":119.4,"txt":"being very vague. This is all industrial"},{"t":122,"txt":"electrician stuff. But, I have to"},{"t":125.6,"txt":"troubleshoot automation software. What"},{"t":127.8,"txt":"kind of automation software? I'm not"},{"t":129.7,"txt":"going to tell you, but there's"},{"t":130.7,"txt":"automation software and I troubleshoot"},{"t":132.6,"txt":"it. If there's no high-level engineers"},{"t":136,"txt":"there, then I am the end-all be-all for"},{"t":138.9,"txt":"troubleshooting automation stuff and"},{"t":140.3,"txt":"that's what I do."},{"t":142.8,"txt":"Next, I may have already said this, but"},{"t":146,"txt":"I have to unders- I have to understand"},{"t":148.6,"txt":"how the machines work at a very high"},{"t":150.8,"txt":"level. I have to understand, you know,"},{"t":153.3,"txt":"the order of operations of every machine"},{"t":156.4,"txt":"and there's only one way to learn that"},{"t":158,"txt":"and that is troubleshooting, learning to"},{"t":160.4,"txt":"communicate with people, becoming a part"},{"t":162.7,"txt":"of the team, and uh, you know, relying"},{"t":165.5,"txt":"on others when needed. And if you just"},{"t":167.7,"txt":"want to be a lone wolf, by all means,"},{"t":169.4,"txt":"you can do that, but it just makes your"},{"t":171.2,"txt":"job a little bit harder. You can be a"},{"t":173.1,"txt":"lone wolf and then you got to pull up"},{"t":174.5,"txt":"the automation software and figure out"},{"t":176.2,"txt":"things the old-fashioned way. Where if"},{"t":178.2,"txt":"you're just friendly and respectable"},{"t":179.9,"txt":"from the start, people will help you. A"},{"t":182.2,"txt":"lot of times operators have an idea of"},{"t":184,"txt":"what's going on and sometimes no one"},{"t":186.1,"txt":"asks them. I always ask them, \"Hey, man,"},{"t":188.2,"txt":"what do you think is happening?\" And"},{"t":190,"txt":"it's nice cuz it shows respect to them"},{"t":192.4,"txt":"and they respect you and we all respect"},{"t":194.3,"txt":"each other and we all have a good day."},{"t":196.8,"txt":"We'll have a little meeting at the"},{"t":197.9,"txt":"beginning of the shift and they will"},{"t":199,"txt":"give you assignments on what you got to"},{"t":200.5,"txt":"get done throughout the day, but that's"},{"t":202.2,"txt":"not how we get most of our work. See,"},{"t":203.7,"txt":"most of our work is intermittent and"},{"t":205.3,"txt":"sporadic and what it is is people will"},{"t":206.8,"txt":"call us. They call us to say, \"Hey,"},{"t":208.2,"txt":"electrician, I need help with"},{"t":209.3,"txt":"something.\" And I've had that experience"},{"t":211,"txt":"at every at every job that I've worked"},{"t":212.9,"txt":"at. A lot of the job is maintenance. A"},{"t":215.4,"txt":"lot of the job is diagnosing, figuring"},{"t":217.5,"txt":"out what's going on. Sometimes you're"},{"t":219.2,"txt":"fixing operator issues and sometimes"},{"t":222,"txt":"there's a real issue to solve."},{"t":227,"txt":"It should be noted that not every day is"},{"t":229.4,"txt":"super chaotic. It's hit or miss. Like I"},{"t":232.1,"txt":"have days where I'm on my feet for the"},{"t":233.9,"txt":"entire shift and that is not an"},{"t":235.5,"txt":"exaggeration. Um part of that's on me."},{"t":238.3,"txt":"Sometimes, you know, I'll put off my"},{"t":240,"txt":"breaks or whatever if there's a lot"},{"t":241.6,"txt":"going on."},{"t":242.7,"txt":"But some days are busy, some days are"},{"t":244.8,"txt":"kind of slow. So keep that in mind."},{"t":247.5,"txt":"Next duty for an industrial electrician"},{"t":250,"txt":"is wiring things up. Some companies will"},{"t":253.8,"txt":"do this more than others. Some companies"},{"t":255.7,"txt":"you'll just be wiring stuff a lot."},{"t":258.2,"txt":"Um in my experience most of my jobs it's"},{"t":261.4,"txt":"few and far between. Mostly just wiring"},{"t":263.1,"txt":"up motors or running a little bit of"},{"t":264.6,"txt":"conduit. So wiring things up and that"},{"t":267.3,"txt":"includes reading electrical schematics."},{"t":269.7,"txt":"While we're talking about wiring things"},{"t":270.9,"txt":"up, we also test motors, we test"},{"t":273.2,"txt":"contactors, just looking at motor"},{"t":275.4,"txt":"control circuits, drives, the whole"},{"t":278,"txt":"nine, figuring out what's going on with"},{"t":280.3,"txt":"these motors."},{"t":284.1,"txt":"I talked a little bit earlier about the"},{"t":286.1,"txt":"independence of working on an off shift."},{"t":288.8,"txt":"Um yeah, in a way we are we are in"},{"t":292.6,"txt":"charge of making sure the machines are"},{"t":294.8,"txt":"running. So in a way I'm a supervisor. I"},{"t":298.4,"txt":"supervise inanimate objects, but I still"},{"t":301.2,"txt":"supervise them. I keep them going. So"},{"t":303.9,"txt":"there's a little bit of pride that comes"},{"t":305.3,"txt":"with that. So that's pretty cool."},{"t":307.7,"txt":"I also periodically will do like some"},{"t":310,"txt":"construction work, running conduit,"},{"t":312.4,"txt":"just, you know, installing devices. So"},{"t":315.3,"txt":"that's stuff that needs to be done. A"},{"t":316.8,"txt":"lot of times I'll work with engineers"},{"t":318.7,"txt":"and supervisors and kind of be a part of"},{"t":322.3,"txt":"these projects. They say what they need"},{"t":324.3,"txt":"done and I get it done for Another thing"},{"t":326.7,"txt":"we got to do is preventive maintenance,"},{"t":329.2,"txt":"PMs. Those are little work orders that"},{"t":331.3,"txt":"you get. And a lot of times it's really"},{"t":333.5,"txt":"mundane stuff that just has to be done,"},{"t":335.8,"txt":"you know, every month or every 3 months"},{"t":337.8,"txt":"or every 6 months. Just to, you know,"},{"t":340,"txt":"keep the machines operational. Generally"},{"t":342.2,"txt":"they have something to do with"},{"t":343.1,"txt":"electricity cuz I am an electrician. And"},{"t":345.8,"txt":"yeah, so mundane PMs."},{"t":351,"txt":"Another duty as a factory industrial"},{"t":353,"txt":"electrician is training apprentices. I"},{"t":355.8,"txt":"will often have an apprentice working"},{"t":357.2,"txt":"with me. It is my job to show them the"},{"t":359.7,"txt":"ropes, give them guidance, and keep them"},{"t":361.8,"txt":"safe."},{"t":364,"txt":"Speaking of safe, we also lock things"},{"t":367.2,"txt":"out or you know, we're in charge of"},{"t":368.8,"txt":"monitoring power. Like we are the"},{"t":371,"txt":"hands-on guys that deal with all the"},{"t":372.5,"txt":"high power stuff. So, if you know, I'll"},{"t":375.8,"txt":"just leave it at that. We do a we're"},{"t":377.2,"txt":"very involved with a lot of the little"},{"t":378.6,"txt":"lockout tagout, a lot of the safety"},{"t":380.4,"txt":"procedures at the factory."},{"t":382.5,"txt":">> [sighs]"},{"t":383.3,"txt":">> The way it works is at every company"},{"t":385.1,"txt":"I've ever worked for is at the beginning"},{"t":386.4,"txt":"of the shift you have a meeting, you get"},{"t":388.6,"txt":"given assignments."},{"t":390.9,"txt":"Um you have these scheduled assignments,"},{"t":392.6,"txt":"you get to them as you can, and you just"},{"t":394.8,"txt":"keep the factory running. When things"},{"t":396.3,"txt":"don't work,"},{"t":397.5,"txt":"you go fix them. And it's like that"},{"t":399.5,"txt":"everywhere. The beautiful thing about"},{"t":401.4,"txt":"being an industrial electrician or"},{"t":403.5,"txt":"instrumentation technician or automation"},{"t":406,"txt":"technician is that all these companies"},{"t":408,"txt":"use the same equipment. I just I always"},{"t":410.3,"txt":"work on the same equipment. I've been"},{"t":411.6,"txt":"doing this for 9 years at five different"},{"t":413.5,"txt":"companies. I've been working on the same"},{"t":415,"txt":"equipment the whole time. It's a"},{"t":416.8,"txt":"beautiful thing, and it is the type of"},{"t":419.9,"txt":"job that will give you some really"},{"t":423.8,"txt":"beautiful beautiful things. And for me,"},{"t":426.4,"txt":"those beautiful things have been"},{"t":429.1,"txt":"a very nice income,"},{"t":431.5,"txt":"a lot of respect from others, and people"},{"t":434,"txt":"depend on you, a lot of self-respect"},{"t":437,"txt":"when you know that you have saved the"},{"t":439.9,"txt":"company tens of thousands of dollars in"},{"t":442.8,"txt":"a shift."},{"t":444.2,"txt":"I I never say, \"Oh, I'm underpaid.\" No,"},{"t":447.2,"txt":"I'm like, \"Man, that's awesome that I"},{"t":449.1,"txt":"can be such a big part of this company.\""},{"t":453.6,"txt":"Uh I I really enjoy that, and I feel so"},{"t":456,"txt":"proud of myself for that. So, it's easy"},{"t":457.6,"txt":"to take pride in your work."},{"t":469.2,"txt":">> Perfect."},{"t":470.3,"txt":">> [music]"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"So,"},{"t":0.56,"w":"you're"},{"t":0.68,"w":"considering"},{"t":1.12,"w":"a"},{"t":1.16,"w":"career"},{"t":1.56,"w":"as"},{"t":1.72,"w":"an"},{"t":1.84,"w":"industrial"},{"t":2.4,"w":"electrician."},{"t":3.28,"w":"In"},{"t":3.36,"w":"this"},{"t":3.48,"w":"video,"},{"t":3.68,"w":"I"},{"t":3.76,"w":"just"},{"t":3.88,"w":"want"},{"t":4,"w":"to"},{"t":4.08,"w":"talk"},{"t":4.28,"w":"about"},{"t":4.8,"w":"what"},{"t":4.96,"w":"I"},{"t":5.08,"w":"actually"},{"t":5.52,"w":"do"},{"t":5.84,"w":"every"},{"t":6.12,"w":"day,"},{"t":6.52,"w":"and"},{"t":6.64,"w":"I"},{"t":6.72,"w":"have"},{"t":6.88,"w":"news"},{"t":7.16,"w":"for"},{"t":7.32,"w":"you."},{"t":8,"w":"It's"},{"t":8.2,"w":"not"},{"t":8.56,"w":"installing"},{"t":9.16,"w":"wires"},{"t":9.8,"w":"and"},{"t":9.92,"w":"running"},{"t":10.16,"w":"conduit."},{"t":10.76,"w":"That's"},{"t":10.96,"w":"actually"},{"t":11.2,"w":"a"},{"t":11.24,"w":"very"},{"t":11.48,"w":"small"},{"t":11.76,"w":"part"},{"t":11.96,"w":"of"},{"t":12.04,"w":"the"},{"t":12.12,"w":"job."},{"t":12.88,"w":"It's"},{"t":13.04,"w":"more"},{"t":13.24,"w":"complicated"},{"t":13.84,"w":"than"},{"t":13.92,"w":"that."},{"t":14.44,"w":"Come"},{"t":14.64,"w":"with"},{"t":14.8,"w":"me"},{"t":14.96,"w":"for"},{"t":15.12,"w":"a"},{"t":15.16,"w":"couple"},{"t":15.44,"w":"minutes."},{"t":16.04,"w":"Let's"},{"t":16.2,"w":"talk"},{"t":16.375,"w":"[music]"},{"t":16.44,"w":"about"},{"t":17.2,"w":"job"},{"t":17.52,"w":"duties"},{"t":18.04,"w":"as"},{"t":18.2,"w":"an"},{"t":18.28,"w":"industrial"},{"t":18.92,"w":"electrician."},{"t":20.96,"w":">>"},{"t":20.96,"w":"[music]"},{"t":23.36,"w":">>"},{"t":23.36,"w":"Troubleshooting"},{"t":24.12,"w":"circuits."},{"t":24.68,"w":"A"},{"t":24.72,"w":"lot"},{"t":24.92,"w":"of"},{"t":25,"w":"times,"},{"t":25.36,"w":"machines"},{"t":25.8,"w":"don't"},{"t":26.08,"w":"work."},{"t":26